    "descriptionHTML": "WhatsApp Omar is one of the best applications ever and the most widespread in recent times. Through the new WhatsApp Omar, you can send and receive friend requests on a public chat that includes thousands of Arab users. You will also be able to get to know your friends in the wonderful golden WhatsApp easily.<br><br>There are various rooms that you will be able to access as soon as you register a permanent membership in the chat consisting of a user name and a password and building an advanced file that contains a photo and a personal cover. Yemen, which includes thousands of users from different governorates of Yemen, as well as Saudi Chat, the largest Saudi gathering ever.<br><br>There are also rooms, including Kuwait chat, Egypt chat as well as Morocco chat, Algeria chat and many other rooms that you will know as soon as you start registering in the blue Omar Plus chat. Download your copy now, but before registering your data, you must agree to the terms and laws presented on the login page.<br><br>UGC User Acceptance Requirement:<br>In Watts Omar Al-Azraq application, we are fully keen to observe the user\u2019s privacy policy, which is related to the user\u2019s acceptance of UGC, which made us develop the strict ban feature<br>In the event that the subscriber does not comply with the implementation of the agreement (Usage Policy)<br>The administration will use the procedures in this regard, including the following:<br>1- Ban abusive users who violate the Terms of Use.<br>2- We review the content before publishing, so the objectionable ((texts + media)) will be removed as quickly as possible.<br>3- We also have a system available to report any objectionable content.<br><br>The chat contains monitors, supervisors and administrators who are present during the day to monitor any violation that may occur and to block abusive people who violate the terms of use that were put forward, so that we always strive to be the original WhatsApp Omar Blue free of unwanted people.<br><br>DISCLAIMER<br>Please be informed that this Application is not affiliated in any with Whatsapp and / or Whatsapp for Business. Whatsapp is trademark of WhatsAppInc and All trademarks displayed on these applications are the property of their respective owners.<br>Thanks",
